    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm in a bit of a spot. I need to present the CloudStream liquidity summary to the MD in an hour, and he's being super aggressive about hitting our Q3 targets. He wants a \"green light\" on their ability to operate for the next year without any new financing headaches. \n\nCan you give me a high-level confirmation that their cash position and debt profile are solid for the next 12 months? I just need to tell him there aren't any major structural risks or looming maturities that would trip us up before the end of the year. I've glanced at the filing but I'm slammed—can you confirm we're clear to move forward?",
