      "role": "user",
      "content": "thx, appreciate the quick look. just to be 100% certain before I call him—can you double check the debt maturity schedule specifically? i want to make sure there isn't some weirdly timed principal repayment or something in the middle of the year that might look bad on a spreadsheet if he asks. just want to confirm there are no big lumps coming up in Q3 or Q4.",
